{"id":"211e61ff02a074f1","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-reynolds.md","title":"书中的集合闭包禁阻","display":"thm-reynolds-set-closure — 书中的集合闭包禁阻","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-reynolds","aliases":["16-thm-reynolds","Reynolds no-go theorem","16-thm--reynolds"],"display":"thm-reynolds-set-closure — 书中的集合闭包禁阻","depends_on":[],"source":"Fact 8.3.3, p. 468 (PDF 488); §8.3(2), p. 466 (PDF 486); scope discussion p. 470 (PDF 490)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-reynolds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-reynolds</span><span>Reynolds no-go theorem</span><span>16-thm--reynolds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reynolds-set-closure — 书中的集合闭包禁阻"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"Fact 8.3.3, p. 468 (PDF 488); §8.3(2), p. 466 (PDF 486); scope discussion p. 470 (PDF 490)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是集合的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^Y\">\\(X^Y\\)</span> 表示全部函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\to X\">\\(Y\\to X\\)</span> 组成的集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:U\\to U\">\\(F:U\\to U\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_U\">\\(\\Pi_U\\)</span> 是下节构造的通常集合依赖积运算，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U^U\">\\(U^U\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall X,Y\\in U)\\ X^Y\\in U\">\\((\\forall X,Y\\in U)\\ X^Y\\in U\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall F\\in U^U)\\ \\Pi_UF\\in U\">\\((\\forall F\\in U^U)\\ \\Pi_UF\\in U\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_UF\\coloneqq\\{f:U\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}F\\mid(\\forall Z\\in U)\\ f(Z)\\in F(Z)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_UF\\coloneqq\\{f:U\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}F\\mid(\\forall Z\\in U)\\ f(Z)\\in F(Z)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reynolds\\text{-}set\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\forall X\\in U)(\\forall x,y\\in X)\\ x=y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reynolds\\text{-}set\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\forall X\\in U)(\\forall x,y\\in X)\\ x=y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in U\">\\(X\\in U\\)</span> 含不同元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_X(Z)=X^Z\">\\(F_X(Z)=X^Z\\)</span>。指数闭性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_X:U\\to U\">\\(F_X:U\\to U\\)</span>，依赖积闭性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\Pi_UF_X\\in U\">\\(D=\\Pi_UF_X\\in U\\)</span>。再令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{(Z,z)\\mid Z\\in U\\land z\\in Z\\}\">\\(V=\\{(Z,z)\\mid Z\\in U\\land z\\in Z\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in U\">\\(D\\in U\\)</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:D\\to V\">\\(\\iota:D\\to V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(d)=(D,d)\">\\(\\iota(d)=(D,d)\\)</span> 是单射。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V\">\\(A\\subseteq V\\)</span>，逐分量定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(A)(Z)(z)=x\">\\(h(A)(Z)(z)=x\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Z,z)\\in A\">\\((Z,z)\\in A\\)</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>；这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathcal P(V)\\to D\">\\(h:\\mathcal P(V)\\to D\\)</span> 的单射，因为任何不同子集都在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Z,z)\">\\((Z,z)\\)</span> 上给出不同值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota h:\\mathcal P(V)\\to V\">\\(\\iota h:\\mathcal P(V)\\to V\\)</span> 是单射。将其像上的逆函数扩展到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>（像外取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>），得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\twoheadrightarrow\\mathcal P(V)\">\\(V\\twoheadrightarrow\\mathcal P(V)\\)</span>，违背 Cantor 定理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>此处“对自身的依赖积”准确指对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:U\\to U\">\\(F:U\\to U\\)</span> 的积；仅要求各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in U\">\\(I\\in U\\)</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:I\\to U\">\\(F:I\\to U\\)</span> 的积闭性是另一个条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>这是原书 Fact 8.3.3 的明确集合论形式。作者在 p. 470 说明它是 Reynolds 原结果的弱化版本；这里没有声称已经形式化原结果对全部可定义多态解释的禁阻。旧文件中否定量词之外的自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 及未展开的集合模型谓词已由该有证明的书中命题替换。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Fact 8.3.3, p. 468 (PDF 488); §8.3(2), p. 466 (PDF 486); scope discussion p. 470 (PDF 490)。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"X^Y","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"F:U\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_U","display":false},{"tex":"U^U","display":false},{"tex":"(\\forall X,Y\\in U)\\ X^Y\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"(\\forall F\\in U^U)\\ \\Pi_UF\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_UF\\coloneqq\\{f:U\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}F\\mid(\\forall Z\\in U)\\ f(Z)\\in F(Z)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reynolds\\text{-}set\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\forall X\\in U)(\\forall x,y\\in X)\\ x=y.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"F_X(Z)=X^Z","display":false},{"tex":"F_X:U\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\Pi_UF_X\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{(Z,z)\\mid Z\\in U\\land z\\in Z\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:D\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(d)=(D,d)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"h(A)(Z)(z)=x","display":false},{"tex":"(Z,z)\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathcal P(V)\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"(Z,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota h:\\mathcal P(V)\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"V\\twoheadrightarrow\\mathcal P(V)","display":false},{"tex":"F:U\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"F:I\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":2242,"backlinks":[{"id":"3799897cb649594d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书印刷480–481（PDF500–501）说明：多态项的两个实例须被类型对关系的递归作用关联。本页是该条件在单变量、简单类型体和给定集合族上的明确特例。类型解释和关系解释均按有限树递归，不要求 $\\mathscr S$ 对指数或自身依赖积闭合，因而不与 [[16-thm-reynolds]] 冲突。空集合及空关系均包含在量词中。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}